PolicyValue CA policy ledger
============================

The data in this directory (ledger/records/**, ledger/schema/**, ledger/CHANGELOG.md) is licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International licence (CC BY 4.0).

  Legal code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode
  Summary:    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

Attribute as: "PolicyValue CA policy ledger (CC BY 4.0), <ledger tag>, https://github.com/kavindhyamdksp/ca-policy-value".

The code that reads this data (src/pv) is licensed separately under Apache-2.0 (see ../LICENSE).

Third-party information and required attributions
-------------------------------------------------

Records cite their sources individually (sources[].url, publisher, published, retrieved). Values are
short factual parameters with brief verbatim excerpts (<= 25 words) for verification; no source document
is redistributed.

Government of Canada information is used under the Open Government Licence – Canada:
  "Contains information licensed under the Open Government Licence – Canada."
  https://open.canada.ca/en/open-government-licence-canada

Provincial information is used under the corresponding open licences where they apply:
  Alberta:          Open Government Licence – Alberta   https://open.alberta.ca/licence
  Ontario:          Open Government Licence – Ontario   https://www.ontario.ca/page/open-government-licence-ontario
  British Columbia: Open Government Licence – British Columbia
                    https://www2.gov.bc.ca/gov/content/data/policy-standards/open-data/open-government-licence-bc
  Québec:           Licence Creative Commons 4.0 (Données Québec) where the source is published there;
                    otherwise cited as a factual reference.

Secondary sources (law-firm alerts, ICAP, IETA, news) are cited for dated factual observations only.

No licensed market data (ClearBlue, Argus, Carbon Pulse, etc.) is stored in this ledger (ADR-0007).
Users may inject licensed prices locally through case overrides; overrides are never committed.

The ledger is provided "as is", without warranty. It is not tax, legal or investment advice.
